# Production API base.
#
# The NestJS/Render backend (kilimolink.onrender.com) is NOT the production API:
# Render's free tier spins the service down and it was verified unreachable
# (>110s timeout) on 2026-11-08. Pointing the SPA at it made every production
# build hang on first data fetch.
#
# The live, verified production API is the Cloudflare Pages edge implementation
# in web/functions/ (D1-backed), which answers all smoke endpoints in <1s.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://kilimolink.pages.dev/api/v1
